            {
              "_comment": "PASS 3 (P5): flag 1 now pays out the relay decode (give_item). PASS 5 alignment r1 (M2): its onRead sets found_coordination_traffic only; projection_revised is set when the player names the operation and what is wrong on HaX's hub (deduce_schedule), or by Elena. flag1_submitted comes from the task, the flag-2 pattern.",
